&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Solutions Engineer UAS / Aviation who will play a pivotal role in the future of our company. Our Solutions Engineer will be responsible for the integration, validation, and operational readiness of Auterion-powered drone systems. You’ll collaborate closely with the production team, as well hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, and operations while ensuring that every platform transitions successfully from a physical airframe into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. This role is ideal for someone who lives and breathes drone technology and enjoys bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 and/or other autopilot&amp;nbsp; ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute End-of-Line (EoL) software validation and functional testing to ensure production readiness and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct payload and camera load-seat testing, validating integration stability and operational performance under real-world conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot embedded system issues spanning firmware, communication interfaces, sensors, and hardware-software interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to diagnose integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating closely with engineering and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to validation workflows for complete UAV systems, including components, integrated features, and operational flight configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support full-stack drone integration activities across hardware, embedded firmware, and flight software layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex integration and reliability challenges involving sensors, flight controllers, communication protocols, and power systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on product quality, manufacturing throughput, and deployment readiness through improved validation and testing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to accelerate batch validation and reduce EoL cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with external vendors and equipment providers to support testing infrastructure, hardware integration, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in hands-on flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Aviation Technology, Robotics, Embedded Systems, Electrical Engineering, or related field (M.Sc. optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Autopilot, Mission planning and navigation Software, including firmware flashing, configuration, and flight validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in embedded systems, firmware debugging, and hardware-software integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and/or MAVLink communication protocols or equivalent Datalink protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and flight controller configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based development and debugging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV flight testing, system validation, and troubleshooting in real-world operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of drone manufacturing, QC processes, and End-of-Line testing methodologies is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills when working with cross-functional engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in fast-paced environments with evolving technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for drone technology and a hands-on engineering mindset focused on building reliable flying systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Amsterdam, Netherlands OR Germany - Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: &lt;/strong&gt;up to 40% within DACH, Benelux, Nordics (an other European countries as needed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director, Professional Services, EMEA&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical Project Manager, you’ll lead high-visibility projects, directly contributing to the development and implementation of solutions that truly make a difference. In this role, you’ll tackle complex challenges, working with some of the most advanced technologies in the industry, including cloud and on-prem platforms, and mission-critical systems. You’ll have the opportunity to collaborate with brilliant minds across professional services, sales, engineering, product, and customer teams to deliver solutions that save lives and enhance public trust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Axon, we’re driven by a powerful mission: to protect life, capture truth, and accelerate justice. We’re growing rapidly, and this is your chance to make a lasting impact at a company where innovation meets purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program &amp;amp; Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of complex enterprise-grade product deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee project milestones, resource planning, scope, timeline, and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross-functional stakeholders to ensure alignment, transparency, and on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures project milestones and deadlines are met and associated documentation supports customer acceptance for purposes of revenue recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales scoping and post-sales implementation handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates with a sense of urgency, accuracy, and detail-orientation, while maintaining consistent lines of communication with all teams involved in each project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain customer confidence, especially in high-pressure situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain organized and focused on removing obstacles through creativity and adaptation to rapidly changing circumstances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the relationship with 3rd party integrator and the client throughout the length of the contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Professional Services, Product Managers, and Engineers to align program execution with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between customers and internal teams to manage change requests, solution feasibility, and roadmap alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process inefficiencies and propose improvements to increase deployment speed, quality, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal SOPs, implementation playbooks, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;European citizenship is required in order to work with sensitive Government data, willing to undergo a security check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading and delivering highly complex programs, with demonstrated success in technical program management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing enterprise-level software deployments, infrastructure projects, or large-scale enterprise application programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in delivering complex projects involving cross-functional teams, including sales, engineering, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of program/project management tools and methodologies to track, report, and deliver on objectives. (PMP, PRINCE2, SCRUM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience gathering requirements, optimizing workflows, and facilitating change management within teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software configurations and coding experience (particularly JSON) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced communication and presentation skills, with the ability to distill technical concepts for diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in guiding client and internal teams through ambiguity, driving alignment, and executing on shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently searching for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Working Student (Werkstudent) HR Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Germany and support our HR Operations team across the full employee lifecycle. This role gives you hands-on insight into German HR administration, payroll and labor law, and the chance to contribute to HR projects in an international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and offboarding processes, from preparing welcome documents and system set-up to exit paperwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update staff records in our HR system (HiBob) and the digital personnel file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare employment contracts, contract amendments, employment confirmations, reference letters and other certificates using our templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help collate monthly payroll input (starters, leavers, salary changes, bonuses) for German payroll and prepare it for review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key dates such as probation periods, contract end dates and work permit/visa expiries, and keep documentation audit-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication with external partners and vendors, such as our payroll provider, tax advisors and benefits providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR projects, including process improvements, HiBob optimization and Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled as a student at a German university (Bachelor’s or Master’s) in Human Resources, Business Administration, Psychology, Law or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability of 16–20 hours per week during the semester for at least 6 months (more hours possible during semester breaks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical experience in HR, e.g. through an internship or previous working student role, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in HR processes and German labor law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with MS Office or Google Workspace, especially Google Sheets; experience with HR systems (e.g. HiBob) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and very good English, both spoken and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, with a discreet approach to confidential employee data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive mindset and eagerness to learn in a fast-paced, global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our &lt;strong&gt;Allianz&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our &lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, with a budget of €100/month: mobility support (BVG/HVV), internet allowance, daycare subsidy, &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club&lt;/strong&gt; membership, personal development, and shopping vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental well-being with our&lt;strong&gt; Nilo Health Workplace Mental Health Solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual&lt;strong&gt; training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars,&lt;/strong&gt; and level up your language skills through our &lt;strong&gt;German/English classes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with &lt;strong&gt;27 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position: Account Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Account Specialist &lt;/strong&gt;position is a remote, work-from-home role, as are all positions at Acceleration Partners (a structure central to our culture and vision to change the work/life paradigm). Some travel may be required for client meetings, internal meetings, conferences, and other events. &lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;This position requires verbal and written fluency in German.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Account Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide white glove service to diverse brands investing in influencer marketing campaigns. This role is particularly focused on campaign execution, including but not limited to driving influencer recruitment, managing influencer partnerships, and owning campaign deliverables, tracking, and reporting. The Account Specialist will also drive strategy by analyzing campaign performance, identifying success areas and/or challenge areas, and proactively implementing strategic measures to continuously optimize programs towards goals and objectives.&lt;br&gt;The successful candidate will have strong experience in developing and managing successful, KPI-driven influencer marketing campaigns for consumer products and/or services companies. They will have working knowledge of the overall partner marketing landscape, including affiliate, and the ability to both develop comprehensive strategy as well as capably execute. The successful candidate will be a self-starter that can confidently plug in to any challenging situation with ease and can balance competing priorities well. The Account Specialist must be flexible, willing and able to pivot quickly, and excited to operate successfully in an “intrapreneurial” situation. This person will also have a history of working well with their peers, quickly establishing relationships easily and leading through influence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll work closely with your manager and peers to maximize program effectiveness and create opportunities for growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top 5 Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFLUENCER RECRUITMENT, NEGOTIATING &amp;amp; ONBOARDING –&lt;/strong&gt;Sources new partnership opportunities and creates influencer casting lists. Diligently vets opportunities to ensure brand alignment, authenticity and relevancy prior to presenting to client for approval. Conducts outreach to approved partners and skillfully garners their engagement and participation in the campaign, negotiating when necessary. Supports influencers through campaign onboarding by developing and providing resources to streamline processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFLUENCER PARTNERSHIPS MANAGEMENT &lt;/strong&gt;– Crafts program-wide influencer communications and vital creator resources. Guides influencers on content strategy and creation. Works with influencers to develop content timelines and ensures influencers stay on track with the schedules discussed. Collects content drafts and leads the content review process, including screening to ensure FTC guidelines are met. Closely works with influencers to adjust content strategy as needed, troubleshooting any signs of poor performance to optimize campaign towards goals and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUDITING, REPORTING &amp;amp; ANALYSIS &lt;/strong&gt;– Accountable for auditing program content to ensure compliance with FTC regulations and brand guidelines. Ensures content is tracked accurately and regularly shared with client, along with placement insights, partner insights, and campaign pace towards KPI goals. Performs robust analysis of influencer campaigns using both social analytics and conversion metrics to identify performance trends and areas of opportunity. Proactively provides actionable recommendations to client backed by data and continuously refines strategy to drive growth at scale. Supports team in creation of customized strategy plans, detailed campaign performance summaries and comprehensive hindsight presentations that are delivered to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLIENT SERVICE &amp;amp; COMMUNICATION&lt;/strong&gt;- Consistently provides superior client service and escalates issues or key risks as appropriate. Works to ensure client develops trust in our team by delivering client outputs and communications in the AP way, consistently maintaining quality, accuracy, and precision. Develops and nurtures excellent relationships, supports team in promoting very high client satisfaction and retention rates, and an average 8.5 client rating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;- Own and manage client tasks with minimal supervision, ensuring deadlines are met and tasks are completed accurately. Manages multiple campaigns with solid organizational skills and the ability to focus on and prioritize tasks based on client objectives, flagging any potential delays and keeping the team informed. Has full grasp of each client’s scope of work, delivering what is due under terms; maintains ability to identify new opportunities to drive client success while conjunctively identifying possible goal misalignments, getting to the root of an issue, and working with their team to bring solutions to resolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BY 3 MONTHS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Account Specialist is contributing across a portfolio of influencer programs, collaborating with their team closely to ensure strong alignment with the campaign strategy in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are working with key client contacts to ensure brand alignment with recruitment efforts and content creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have become familiar with AP’s tools and solutions and are equipped to conduct casting for prospective influencers, execute content timelines with influencers, audit content, and ensure performance is tracked and measured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 6 MONTHS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are owning execution of the day-to-day operations of multiple influencer programs with little guidance from your team, including reporting, processing applications, recruiting and casting creators, and crafting partner communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging client or team situations are being managed with guidance from managers and directors collaborating closely to bring a solutions-oriented approach to these situations proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are regularly analyzing client data and strategically leveraging insights to optimize campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client accounts are being handled effectively and strategically, without dropping any balls, and clients are aware of and pleased with this outcome. Clients are being serviced profitably with AP targets, client KPI’s being met, and an average 8.5 client rating is being upheld across campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will regularly present new campaign ideas to managers and demonstrate a clear understanding of program performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 1 YEAR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will troubleshoot and resolve account and creator issues independently, providing valuable insights and actionable recommendations to clients and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be an integral part of each program, developing new ideas and improving processes to create efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will take on new account responsibilities with support from your manager and serve as a thought leader within the team, contributing to relationship-building and firm development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualities of the Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a strong internal motivation to get the job done and done well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only provides superior results and unsurpassed customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhilarated by managing change and comfortable with ambiguity and moving targets&lt;/li&gt;
